<h2><strong>What to Expect at a Pediatric Eye Exam at Austin Optics</strong></h2>
<p>A children&#8217;s eye exam is not the same as an adult exam, and it shouldn&#8217;t feel like one. Dr. Mistry uses child-appropriate techniques, including picture-based charts for younger children who haven&#8217;t yet mastered the alphabet. The exam is gentle and unhurried, usually taking around 30–45 minutes.</p>
